flowchart TD
    Goal[Goal + initial URL] --> Agent[Agent Decision Engine]
    Agent -->|action intents| RPC[JSON-RPC Requests]
    RPC --> Socket[Unix socket]
    Socket --> Server[Daemon handler]
    Server -->|reads/writes| State[daemon_state]
    Server -->|browser command| Playwright
    Server -->|VoiceOver command| Guidepup
    Playwright --> Page[Page URL, title, aria snapshot]
    Guidepup --> VO[VoiceOver cursor, speech, focus]
    Page --> State
    VO --> State
    State --> Agent
    Agent --> Summary[Final summary / report]